    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A refreshing action small Open World RPG, with retro fantasy ambience and unique physics-driven gameplay. In Hybrid Blood you can remember those old time 3d console games but with modern combat mechanics and playstyle.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Wake up, hybrid! Reclaim your domain.</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat enemies packed with diverse mechanics:</strong>\u00a0In <i>Hybrid Blood</i>, each encounter has the potential to introduce new mechanics. Enemy NPCs aren\u2019t just mindless attackers; they\u2019re equipped with abilities a player could have. They can dodge, interact with the environment, coordinate with others, and force you to approach each fight with caution and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/e96a84d2c5d12a3d6579c163050c696a.poster.avif?t=1755756428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/e96a84d2c5d12a3d6579c163050c696a.webm?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/e96a84d2c5d12a3d6579c163050c696a.mp4?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Expand your domain:</strong> As a Hybrid, defeating enemies expands your <i>Vampiric Domain</i>, granting access to higher stat levels and unlocking new abilities. This progression functions similarly to classic character leveling systems with some additions you will discover in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/f3cc9cf5552b09c03b6f3c3f6ea26933.poster.avif?t=1755756428\" width=678 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/f3cc9cf5552b09c03b6f3c3f6ea26933.webm?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/f3cc9cf5552b09c03b6f3c3f6ea26933.mp4?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world full of engaging, additive interactions:</strong> The world of <i>Hybrid Blood</i> is filled with dynamic items\u2014most can be interacted with in various ways or at least destroyed. They can also interact with each other, creating emergent gameplay possibilities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/d6980c016749421887a605317f686e08.poster.avif?t=1755756428\" width=798 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/d6980c016749421887a605317f686e08.webm?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/d6980c016749421887a605317f686e08.mp4?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A refreshing action small Open World RPG, with retro fantasy ambience and unique physics-driven gameplay. In Hybrid Blood you can remember those old time 3d console games but with modern combat mechanics and playstyle.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Wake up, hybrid! Reclaim your domain.</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat enemies packed with diverse mechanics:</strong>\u00a0In <i>Hybrid Blood</i>, each encounter has the potential to introduce new mechanics. Enemy NPCs aren\u2019t just mindless attackers; they\u2019re equipped with abilities a player could have. They can dodge, interact with the environment, coordinate with others, and force you to approach each fight with caution and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/e96a84d2c5d12a3d6579c163050c696a.poster.avif?t=1755756428\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/e96a84d2c5d12a3d6579c163050c696a.webm?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/e96a84d2c5d12a3d6579c163050c696a.mp4?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Expand your domain:</strong> As a Hybrid, defeating enemies expands your <i>Vampiric Domain</i>, granting access to higher stat levels and unlocking new abilities. This progression functions similarly to classic character leveling systems with some additions you will discover in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/f3cc9cf5552b09c03b6f3c3f6ea26933.poster.avif?t=1755756428\" width=678 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/f3cc9cf5552b09c03b6f3c3f6ea26933.webm?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/f3cc9cf5552b09c03b6f3c3f6ea26933.mp4?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world full of engaging, additive interactions:</strong> The world of <i>Hybrid Blood</i> is filled with dynamic items\u2014most can be interacted with in various ways or at least destroyed. They can also interact with each other, creating emergent gameplay possibilities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/d6980c016749421887a605317f686e08.poster.avif?t=1755756428\" width=798 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/d6980c016749421887a605317f686e08.webm?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740690/extras/d6980c016749421887a605317f686e08.mp4?t=1755756428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Step into the role of a Vampire-Human Hybrid, imprisoned for longer than you can remember. Explore a small Open-world RPG and expand your Vampiric Domain. Defeat the local Vampire Lord to claim his territory and begin your quest to dominate\u2014or liberate\u2014the lands.",
